BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:LOVE ONLY featuring CanCon Legend Eddie C and Kiki LeFreak
DTSTART:20261114T220000
DTEND:20261114T220000
UID:d4a26f3db9acbf44b722a8dd4b5d3f77@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:LOVE ONLY - SATURDAY NOV. 14TH FEAT. EDDIE C AND KIKI LEFREAK 
 Bambi’s has a 4AM last call! Special guest Eddie C is coming back to gra
 ce the decks at Bambi’s! Eddie C is a leading figure in the global House
 \, Disco\, Balearic crossover community for more than a decade\, Eddie C h
 as released an impressive array of music across a wide spectrum of labels 
 including Razor-N-Tape\, Karat\, Crue-L\, Wolf Music\, Sleazy Beats\, Jisc
 omusic and Lumberjacks in Hell. Raised in Southern Ontario\, Eddie C&#x27\
 ;s experiments in music began during late 80s Hip Hop and Acid House and i
 nto 90s Rave and Techno culture. Eventually relocating to Berlin\, Germany
  in 2010 \, Eddie C can now be found at such renowned festivals as Montreu
 x Jazz Festival in Tokyo\, Movement in Detroit\, Shambhala\, Meadows in th
 e Mountains in Bulgaria\, Wonderfruit in Thailand and Mareh in Brazil. A r
 egular at Berghain Panorama Bar (Berlin)\, Rex Club (Paris)\, Circus (Osak
 a)\, Womb and Vent (Tokyo)\, Corsica Studios (London) etc. have garnered h
 im a cult following world wide. Supported by Toronto local favourite Kiki 
 LeFreak HOuSE BaLeaRiC NEw WAvE TEcHNo 10pm - 4am Bambi’s 1265 Dundas St
  West ‍
LOCATION:Bambi&#x27\;s\, 1265 Dundas Street West
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/love-only-featuring-cancon-legend-eddie-c-
 and-kiki-lefreak
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
