 ! Looking for stage time to try out your silly lil jokes? Want to hang wit
 h other fem and / or queer comedians? Just want to belly laugh and cure yo
 ur Sunday Scaries? Well you are in luck! Join us for Queen Out Open Mic Co
 medy! This mic is all about a comfy\, inclusive\, and fun live comedy expe
 rience for women and 2SLQBTQIA+ folks. Sign up starts at 6 pm\, with sign 
 up on a first come\, first serve basis. The show starts promptly at 6 30 p
 m\, and will run to approximately 8 - 8 30 pm (depending on the number of 
 sign ups). This mic is open to anyone that identifies as a woman\, fem\, a
 nd / or member of the 2SLGBTQIA+ community. Sorry cis het dude comics - th
 is one&#x27\;s not for you. You are welcome to perform\, attend as an audi
 ence member to support fem and queer comedy\, or both!! Please note that t
 his event is an open mic and not a professional\, ticketed comedy show. We
  do our best to keep the quality high and the vibes good\, but please know
  the nature of open mic comedy means there may be an odd &quot\;miss&quot\
 ;. (FOR MORE INFO SEE TICKET LINK PROVIDED)
