BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Queer Speed Dannecting
DTSTART:20261119T200000
DTEND:20261119T200000
UID:6e8429d386b1019e6f388576542c22af@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Is it speed dating? Is it quick connecting? Yes! QUEER SPEED D
 ANNECTING! Is it speed dating? Is it quick connecting? Yes! What is ‘spe
 ed dannecting’? Some people want to meet people with the possibility (bu
 t not pressure) of dating. Some people want to meet people with the possib
 ility of (but not pressure) of connections. So dating+connecting=dannectin
 g. ‘Dannecting’ is a fast way to meet new people -&gt\; lots of possib
 ilities but no pressure! How does it work? You will have short\, focused c
 onversations with 8 people in 75 minutes. You will have 8 minutes (4 minut
 es each) to ask each other questions that we have provided for you - a mix
  of light and more meaningful questions. You don’t need to plan any ques
 tions - we got that covered! Also\, questions usually won’t repeat\, so 
 your quick chats will stay fresh and interesting. At the end of the 75 min
 utes\, there will be 45 minutes of casual time for you to hang out and hav
 e talks organically with some of the people you just met. We will have a f
 ew things out of the tables (cards\, colouring books\, puzzles) if you wan
 t to do something together. How will you be matched up? We are expecting 5
 0-80 people at this event. This is our fourth time running this it and it 
 will still be an ‘everyone’ edition. Before the event\, you will be se
 nt an optional questionnaire to complete. We will use that to try and make
  sure that at least half of your speed chats are with people who you have 
 a higher likelihood of having a match with. This is an 18+ event and there
  is some grouping by age range. This costs $9 to attend. There are also fi
 fteen $20 spots if you wanna show Glad Day a little extra love! 7:30pm - C
 heck-in/Doors 8pm - Speed Chats Start 9:30pm - Speed Chats End 9:30pm - Ca
 sual Hanging Out Starts 10:00pm - End The entrance\, washrooms and space a
 re wheelchair accessible. Please do not wear perfume or cologne to this ev
 ent. The space does not have a liquor license\, but sober drinks and snack
 s will be available at Glad Day. If you really want to come but don&#x27\;
 t have a way to buy tickets online or need a subsidized spot\, email: vip@
 gladday.ca ‍
LOCATION:Glad Day (32 Lisgar)\, 32 Lisgar
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/queer-speed-dannecting-3
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
