DESCRIPTION:⛓️ UNCUT Presents: Superstarlet A.D. (Dir. John Michael Mc
 Carthy\, USA\, 2000\, 69 min) The world has gone nudie-cutie\, Armageddon 
 style! Men reverted back to neanderthal and women organized into beauty cu
 lts based on hair colour. In Femphis\, where lipstick and ammo are currenc
 y\, Naomi is the leader of the Superstarlet A.D.\, the only beauty cult th
 at believes that all hair colours were created equal. When her girlfriend 
 finds her grandmother’s burlesque film\, Naomi sets out on a mission to 
 find her own grandmother’s films. Under the male gaze of writer/director
  John Michael McCarthy\, these rock’n’roll baddies defend their future
 \, discover their past\, and have lipstick-heavy smooches. A bad boy&#x27\
 ;s vision of bad\, bad girls! Friday\, November 20 At @united.unlimited (D
