BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Groundwork 10: The Party
DTSTART:20261129T183000
DTEND:20261129T183000
UID:3f86253060706f1f07d8aaa48e1ffab8@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Groundwork is a generative workshop space for queer writers. l
 ay the groundwork Idiom To provide the right conditions Groundwork is a ge
 nerative workshop series in Toronto aiming to provide space for queer writ
 ers to access writing time and a writing community\, away from institution
 alized pressures or expectations. Happy Groundwork day! In the name of our
  tenth workshop we&#x27\;re throwing a party. We&#x27\;ll have snacks\, ca
 ke\, wine and readers from our very own time spent crafting work together.
  Come hang and be merry\, maybe you&#x27\;ll get an insight on our excitin
 g next guest we have lined up for the new year. The party will be held on 
 November 29\, 2026 from 6:30 - 8:30pm at the Grape Witches upstairs salon.
  Tickets are PWYC (recommended amount $5-10) and go directly to paying for
  the salon space. No one will be turned away for lack of funds. We look fo
 rward to hosting you ❤️ **********************************************
 ************************************************************ Grape Witches
  is a leader in diversifying and democratizing Toronto’s wine scene. We
 ’ve added a couple of words from their home page for those who are unfam
 iliar with the space. We began as\, and always will be\, industry veterans
  on a mission. Founded in 2015\, Grape Witches began as a series of partie
 s and educational events pouring the rare and delicious organic\, biodynam
 ic and natural wine we loved. The dream? To share the incredible flavours\
 , places and people that made us work in wine - without the stuffy attitud
 e. Fast forward through a few hundred parties big and small\; from geeky w
 inemaker events to sweaty dance parties to the world&#x27\;s largest natur
 al wine booze cruise (yes\, actually!!)\, and you&#x27\;ll find us on Marc
 h 7th 2020 (lol) signing the lease to our first space and launching our na
 tural wine agency\, Grape Witch Imports. ‍
LOCATION:Grape Witches\, 1247 Dundas Street W
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/groundwork-10-the-party
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
