SUMMARY:QEN Open House Fundraiser
DTSTART:20261130T180000
DTEND:20261130T180000
UID:0039ed95049de747b83fe0a4e9aabb7a@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Join us Monday\, November 30 at 6pm for our QEN Open House &am
 p\; Fundraiser! Meet our founding committee\, hear what we’re building f
 or 2027 and help fund the launch of our website and queer business directo
 ry\, a place to discover\, connect with and support our community. Enjoy a
  complimentary welcome drink and snacks Enter our raffle for amazing prize
 s donated by our community Mingle with fellow queer entrepreneurs and make
  some new connections Whether you’re nurturing an idea\, running an esta
 blished business or finding your next direction\, you belong here. Allies\
 , this is your invitation to show up and invest in queer community\, too! 
 Tickets: FREE for queer entrepreneurs | $20 for allies The Queer Entrepren
 eur Network is rooted in community\, connection and reciprocity: sharing w
 hat we know\, showing up for one another and building opportunities for qu
 eer businesses to thrive. Together\, we’re creating the support network 
 we want to be part of. Come meet your community. Help build what comes nex
 t. Reserve your ticket and share this with someone who should be in the ro
 om! ‍
LOCATION:Three Dollar Bill\, 1592 Queen Street West
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/qen-open-house-fundraiser
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
