DTSTART:20261212T210000
DTEND:20261212T210000
UID:f9ee677d1ed02bccb04f87b580bc936b@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:✨ TAYLOR RAVE ✨ Are you ready for it? 💋 Get ready to en
 ter your Tayloredit era and dance the night away as we celebrate the birth
 day of the queen herself! 🎂✨ On December 12\, we’re taking over Lod
 ge on Queen for a full-blown Taylor Rave — going all night and straight 
 into Taylor’s birthday! 🪩💃 🎤 Dance. Sing. Scream the bridge. Re
 peat. Your DJ for the evening is the incomparable Zaylor Zwift\, serving u
 p all your favourite Taylor hits\, deep cuts\, bops\, heartbreak anthems\,
  and songs you just know every word to. And because no Taylor celebration 
 would be complete without some ✨BEJEWELED✨ surprises… 💋 Pop-up dr
 ag performances by Toronto’s #1 Taylor Drag Icon Tay BoBo 💃 Featuring
  the dancing diva herself\, Heaven Lee Hytes Whether you’re in your Love
 r era\, your Reputation era\, still crying over All Too Well\, or simply r
 eady to shake it offuntil the sun comes up — this is your sign to get yo
 ur besties together and make the friendship bracelets. 🫶 ✨ TAYLOR RAV
 E ✨ 📅 December 12 — going into Taylor’s birthday! 📍 Lodge on Q
 ueen 🕘 Doors: 9 PM 🎟️ Tickets: $25 So… are you ready for it? 
 👀 Meet us at midnight. Come in your best Taylor era. Leave with a new c
 ore memory. 💖 It’s been waiting for you. 🪩✨ ‍
LOCATION:251 Queen St W\, 251 Queen St W
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/taylor-rave
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
